    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Design</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Hash maps + per-count linked lists</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/lfu-cache/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 460</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>LFU Cache</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Give every use count its own LRU list, find keys with a map, and track minFreq: a hit moves a node from list f to list f+1 (minFreq moves up only if list f empties), a new key resets minFreq to 1, and eviction takes the tail of list minFreq. get and put O(1); memory O(capacity).</p>\n"
